## Interface: 11509, 20506, 16001
## Title: Spoken Books
## Notes: Books, letters and notes read aloud through the Spoken player.
## Version: 1.0.0
## Author: rusty
## SavedVariables: SpokenBooksDB
## OptionalDeps: SpokenPlayer, SpokenBooksAudio
# SpokenPlayer is the player this addon speaks through. Optional here so a hand-installed
# copy without it loads and says what is missing rather than failing to load at all; addon
# managers install it from the CurseForge dependency. The pack is not a registration
# mechanism either -- it registers itself into SpokenBooksAudioPacks and Audio.lua walks
# that on demand -- so this list is load order only.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\SpokenBooks\Textures\AddonIcon.tga
